    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 54 Answer: Help the main character finish all the burgers.</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Single-reference steps: this level comes from the all-levels table only. The embedded video is the tiebreaker — if a step does not react, follow the video.</div>
