    <h2>Level 54 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the probiotics (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the probiotics on the ground to the main character. Drag the lemonade from the child's hand to the main character. Drag the hamburger to the child.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the chubby kid (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the chubby kid to the main character. Drag the hamburger to the dog. Drag the coffee on the referee's table to the main character.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the main character's zipper (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe down the main character's zipper. Tap on the phone in the kid's pocket. Tap on the food filter on the phone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag the pen (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the pen from the referee's table to the banner. Swipe right to open the toilet door. Drag the empty cup from the table to the toilet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 13</span>
      <strong>Drag the full cup</strong>
      <p>Drag the full cup to the protagonist.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 54 shows “Expel Drunkard”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Helping the beauty drive away the drunkards.”, this is that scene, 11 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
