        <li>Click on the bag on the table.</li>
        <li>Drag the money from the bag to the sleeping bartender.</li>
        <li>Drag the black stockings on the orange-dressed girl's leg to the drunkard.</li>
        <li>Swipe right on the red-haired girl.</li>
    </ol>

